  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukong-visits-the-aquarium-v2.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "cd8917e564d0ffedd1da85ceb0b65da6eb9db591580085d70347e85e6196628c",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "21c2b154cc1e5cfe7066fcf164f95973d336942e6b8381e217e39f988c8d350a",
      "text": "Wukong Visits\nthe Aquarium",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "5a3134f7a4d228120e76f65d1a5a75dbc50ad1c5dbe5924b9afb9e00fe04461e",
      "text": "Wukong brings a little blank\ncard.\n“I will choose one thing to\ndraw!”\n2",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "c2e617294e7d2408a5efd893ca2e1c22933e6513722551f1464bc4c51ecf0e02",
      "text": "Inside, tall kelp sways in the\nwater.\n“A forest under the sea!”\n3",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "1650d592ff7372c98b60585b97adec3a7f9977f558031e391712d84839842e5c",
      "text": "An orange fish hides in the\nkelp.\n“Where did you go?” asks\nWukong.\n4",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "012789181152e1028a2b88227cac12eb29737672ac8b7e36c1fe7aa186533da2",
      "text": "He looks left. He looks right.\nHis tail looks busy, too!\nThe fish is still hiding.\n5",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "38899ed017b009aa4a9439a13ba60f84ca8e40261de620a19a1defbb136f6ca9",
      "text": "Ao Bing stays in one spot.\n“Let’s wait right here.”\n6",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "38a9163405dea27a276acf680aead7202a6a8064437c29ab6c7c57f4a42aa2c2",
      "text": "They wait. The kelp sways.\nA little orange face peeks\nout.\n7",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b6a2529def71ddaa0c666c372c5617d07f214b4b7ddcd3ad59d0cec09411bbbc",
      "text": "“There you are!” says\nWukong.\nHe holds up his blank card.\n“I could draw this!”\n8",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ccd82bda3d2c1119485dee5690cfc51c95c47dce066af30621c44f00fc389f8e",
      "text": "Then they find a glowing blue\nwindow.\nJellyfish float inside.\nWukong slows his steps.\n9",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "085849be4b9ca00df7efea87ba1ecdb12d7c20ba71bdb08faf3af9a09e787bd3",
      "text": "One jellyfish opens, then\ncloses.\n“Is that a tiny umbrella?”\n10",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "4f207f26d10d7d5dac701e717f9f33eb3f731c19a4f92bd27b2ea05ad8557126",
      "text": "“A jellyfish,” says Sandy.\nWukong makes an umbrella\nwith his hands.\n11",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "afcf5cc046496ebb02859168154dd7bba142811ccf36b981d4f8f044687f617e",
      "text": "“I want to draw that, too!”\nHis card still has no picture.\n12",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "96da12eabdc577fe64c4f0e9360325e214f81bde3021b5dc1486e9f335876110",
      "text": "At the next window, an otter\nfloats.\nIts tummy points up.\n13",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "3a69fa0ccbbe864c0eaba44b24d88e0c2b4c7d78c6854ffae14a980480028c6f",
      "text": "It rubs its fur with its paws.\n“Are you washing your\ncheeks?”\n14",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "5764f622c54f240ef5081225c44e33f5c074998f6502648f05feb1addf4a714e",
      "text": "Wukong rubs his own fuzzy\ncheeks.\n“Mine are fuzzy, too!”\nAo Bing giggles.\n15",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "39c30aac8aa28eb561122afa1262a623916156426e2ec0ddba42fea2942061a1",
      "text": "Fish. Jellyfish. Otter.\n“How can I choose just one?”\n16",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a8117a7354ef1d24b3a7cc53f70e8e37aac433870b0a82b8e0cd5f97e7d860ad",
      "text": "Outside, they sit beside the\nsea.\nSandy puts the card on the\nbench.\n17",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-18.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f7ca96820a77b8ba0963c0ed74ba6b4adea216957e7bd1e1135d9ce82dd2fd77",
      "text": "“Could you draw three little\npictures?”\nAo Bing points to the card.\nWukong draws three small\nboxes.\n18",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-19.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "2b075a8c97715ed92af30529eb4c1dfee1d8cf1dc779efef6abc67b99fa1e151",
      "text": "A fish in kelp. A jellyfish. An\notter.\nThree little pictures. One big\nday!\n19",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-20.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "0dd0823b24913054ba4a080aee2a747fcc54da82e98573593ee212cb3245162f",
      "text": "Wukong waves at the sea.\nHis tail makes a little wave,\ntoo.\n20",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-21.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b6f14abd05c0cd0e1ecc06a7a775d666ab6e243347598fcce36a91498c2c38c0",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\nThank you for reading!\nWe hope you and your little reader\nenjoyed this little adventure.\nMore free stories\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends\nRead, download and print - always free.\nRead more free stories\nIf you enjoyed this story, you are welcome\nto support more. Support is optional.\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nCreated by Peihong Guo\nStory and art made with AI assistance and human editing.\n© 2026 Peihong Guo\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0 · Attribution · NonCommercial · NoDerivatives\ncreativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/",
